{"_id":"69663b083eeddc26d7c3ab56","roadmapSlug":"ruby","nodeId":"E6k00oTuohQOBkPNyuKAA","description":"# RSpec\n\nRSpec is a testing tool for Ruby. It provides a domain-specific language (DSL) for writing tests in a clear and readable format. RSpec focuses on behavior-driven development (BDD), allowing developers to describe the expected behavior of their code in a way that is easy to understand and maintain.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"RSpec","url":"https://rspec.info/","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd731"},{"type":"article","title":"Getting Started with RSpec","url":"https://semaphore.io/community/tutorials/getting-started-with-rspec","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd732"},{"type":"article","title":"Introduction to RSpec","url":"https://www.theodinproject.com/lessons/ruby-introduction-to-rspec","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd733"},{"type":"video","title":"RSpec Ruby Tutorial","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FgGOa7Mxoxg&list=PL_noPv5wmuO9Z3h_Nq4aEPfzGqrJzhthb","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd734"},{"type":"video","title":"How to Test Your Ruby Code With RSpec","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LdutLs5-ObI","_id":"6a7f4b2bcb44947debcfd735"}],"createdAt":"2026-01-13T12:31:04.664Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:06:51.273Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/ruby/content/E6k00oTuohQOBkPNyuKAA.md"}